    refine rfree_seed_count_le S _ hJ p hJbox (chainLength_spec F) hSs hp (by omega) hSchar
      hSDw hSj hSY hSZ hSmixed hSwa hSan selected (tailSeeds F selected Gamma) nodes x u0 u1
      hinj hnodesS ?_ ?_ ?_ ?_
