    · intro γ hγ; exact (Finset.mem_filter.mp hγ).2
    · intro γ hγ; exact hagreementS γ (tailSeeds_subset F selected Gamma hγ)
    · exact noLargeSelectedPencil_mono selected Gamma _ S.w S.errors
